@startuml
title 顾客下单时序图
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

actor "顾客" as Customer
participant "顾客端" as UI
participant "购物车与下单服务" as OrderService
participant "菜品与库存服务" as MenuService
participant "模拟支付" as Pay
participant "日志与审计服务" as LogService
database "数据库" as DB

Customer -> UI : 选择地址、提交订单
UI -> OrderService : placeOrder(requestId, cartId, addressId)
OrderService -> DB : 按 requestId 查询已有订单
alt 已存在
  DB --> OrderService : 原订单
  OrderService --> UI : 返回原订单（幂等）
else 新请求
  OrderService -> MenuService : 检查购物车菜品上架/售罄/价格
  MenuService --> OrderService : 最新价格和库存
  alt 校验失败
    OrderService --> UI : 返回失败原因
  else 校验通过
    OrderService -> MenuService : 扣减库存（事务）
    OrderService -> DB : 保存订单、明细、地址/价格快照
    OrderService -> Pay : 模拟支付
    Pay --> OrderService : 支付成功
    OrderService --> UI : 订单号，状态待接单
    OrderService -> LogService : 记录下单和库存变更
  end
end
note over OrderService,DB : 订单状态变更与库存扣减在同一事务中
@enduml
